      "replacement": "Phase 5 (Solution Hardening & Approval) and Phase 8 (Implementation Specs) are NEW phases added on 2026-09-10 at the user's direction. They have no counterpart in the pre-externalization source snapshot and are therefore not normalizations of anything. Phase 5 exists because product approval previously preceded competitive research, which made research a correction loop; competitive research moved into Phase 2 (Problem Framing) and its freed slot now carries the single solution approval. Phase 8 exists because field, constraint, API and migration detail were previously decided in the same phase as entity ownership. Their phase_map entries are marked '(no snapshot counterpart)' rather than given a fabricated source_name.",
